  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IOM Flash Appeal for Ukraine and Neighbouring Countries 2022 - Norway</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Almost eight years after the onset of the crisis in eastern Ukraine, we are now witnessing a level of intensity across the entirety of country that seems almost unimaginable. With violence now spread country-wide, internal displacement has over 8 million people since 24 February, and this will undoubtably rise as fighting continues to intensify, including targeting of civilian and residential infrastructure. New waves of displacement and the deteriorating living conditions of the most vulnerable will continue to exacerbate in the current context. Through this project, IOM is providing multi-sectoral interventions focused on humanitarian assistance to vulnerable displaced and conflict-affected populations in Ukraine and neighbouring countries.</narrative>
  </description>
